cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: Elmo
abstract: >-
  Elmo is an open-source, self-hosted AI visibility platform for Answer Engine
  Optimization (AEO). It tracks how AI answer engines such as ChatGPT, Claude,
  Perplexity, Gemini, and Google AI Overviews mention, cite, and describe
  brands, so teams can benchmark competitors and grow their visibility in AI
  answers.
type: software
authors:
